        <h1>ConvFactorNet — Deep Convolutional Factor Prediction with Explainable AI for Enhanced Investment Strategy</h1>
        <div class="sub">A CNN reads the whole cross-section at one date and emits latent factors instead of returns; betas come from OLS on those factors. Grad-CAM then says which inputs the factors were built from — and re-training on only those inputs improves the strategy.</div>
