          <figcaption><b>Figure 1.</b> The pipeline, drawn for this page. The network never sees a return; it only ever sees the cross-section. The return identity is what carries gradient back into it, and the same last convolutional layer that produces the factors is the one Grad-CAM reads.</figcaption>
